description: TypeScript bans for Bookreader
globs: "**/*.{ts,tsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# TypeScript bans

- No `any`
- No `console.log` in `apps/` or `packages/`
- No raw SQL in Library, routes, or pages
- No EPUB parsing in a React file
- No global reading progress
- Named export, file name matches the page (`LibraryPage.tsx`)
